## Troubleshooting

### Merge Conflicts

```bash
# When git pull fails due to conflicts
# 1. See conflicted files
git status

# 2. Edit conflicted files manually
# Look for markers: <<<<<<< HEAD, =======, >>>>>>>

# 3. Stage resolved files
git add path/to/resolved/file

# 4. Complete the merge
git commit -m "Resolve merge conflicts"
```

### Undo Recent Push (Be Careful!)

```bash
# Undo last pushed commit (don't do this on shared branches!)
git push --force-with-lease origin HEAD~1:branch-name
```

### Find Lost Commits

```bash
# Reflog shows all commits (even deleted ones)
git reflog

# Recover a lost commit
git checkout <lost-commit-hash>
git checkout -b recovered-branch
```

